{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/768504-help-needed-with-an-interlock","id":768504,"title":"Help needed with an Interlock","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-11-18T07:57:00-08:00","id":768504,"title":"Help needed with an Interlock","content":"My demon has just unlocked her second Key, and I'm spinning my wheels trying to develop an interlock to present to the GM. She's an Inquisitor Messenger with emphases on the social and the supernatural (it's a mixed splat campaign). Her first Key is 'You Can Tell Me' and the second is 'Social Engineering.' They're very similar in scope - YCTM makes the target tell the truth, and SE makes the target give away secrets - and I'm not sure what conceptual space bridges them.<br /> <br /> Any suggestions?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9459-smilingbandit2","name":"smilingbandit2","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-18T08:21:18-08:00","id":768520,"title":"","content":"The first idea that occurs to me is an ability that lets you know when you come across someone with a secret relevant to whatever you're currently investigating. Or maybe something that lets you speed through Social Maneuvering when wheedling information out of your targets.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1423-espritdecalmar","name":"espritdecalmar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1423_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"941"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-18T09:52:41-08:00","id":768570,"title":"","content":"Maybe look at some of the other elements of what the Embeds do? YCTM exploits the Demon's quantum state to <i>force</i> them to behaves a certain way (or to make something, in this case telling the truth, objectively true). SE tricks the subject into revealing secrets by hacking their &quot;trust algorithms&quot;.<br /> <br /> Maybe it forces them to tell a secret, even to others? Maybe it makes them believe a &quot;secret&quot; is true? Or that X <i>should</i> be a secret? Maybe you bypass the information angle and force a target to change form (that they are keeping &quot;hidden&quot;) or use a &quot;secret&quot; ability (like making a Vampire use a Discipline in public)?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-18T12:32:25-08:00","id":768660,"title":"","content":"You Can Tell Me forces truth when the target is speaking, and Social Engineering causes the target to unconsciously volunteer secrets. You could use this to create an Interlock that causes the target to inadvertantly give away deeper truths about themselves, which is a great way to work in your character's specialty in the supernatural. Freudian Slip, or whatever you might want to call it, causes the target's language to inadvertantly give away details about their spiritual nature. Doesn't work on demons or angels in Cover, but an angel in ephemeral form might find itself using metaphors that reference its ban or bane, a vampire might talk about being dead tired or out for blood, etc. Used on mortal humans, it might instead hint at that mortal's most vulnerable breaking points or defining personality traits.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/522-stupid-loserman","name":"Stupid Loserman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar522_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1824"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-19T08:37:01-08:00","id":769279,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Stupid Loserman</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/768504-help-needed-with-an-interlock?p=768660#post768660\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">You Can Tell Me forces truth when the target is speaking, and Social Engineering causes the target to unconsciously volunteer secrets. You could use this to create an Interlock that causes the target to inadvertantly give away deeper truths about themselves, which is a great way to work in your character's specialty in the supernatural. Freudian Slip, or whatever you might want to call it, causes the target's language to inadvertantly give away details about their spiritual nature. Doesn't work on demons or angels in Cover, but an angel in ephemeral form might find itself using metaphors that reference its ban or bane, a vampire might talk about being dead tired or out for blood, etc. Used on mortal humans, it might instead hint at that mortal's most vulnerable breaking points or defining personality traits.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I like it! How about &quot;I Do Not Drink...Wine&quot; as a title?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9459-smilingbandit2","name":"smilingbandit2","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}